   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EPOPA Phase III</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">EPOPA phase III</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The EPOPA project initiated in the mid-1990s, as a &apos;Development through Trade&apos; concept was designed to work directly with exporters to develop orgnic products for export. The main benefit of the programme was for rural producer communities to increase their export volume and value while at the same time exposing the country&apos;s agric sector to sustainable farming techniques.</narrative>
  </description>
